INSERT INTO `b2c_blogs` (`entry_id`, `title`, `description`, `image`, `active_flag`) VALUES
(1, 'How to Plan a Perfect Family Vacation in India', '<div><b>Make Every Family Trip Stress-Free and Memorable</b></div><div><br></div><div>Planning a family holiday is more than just booking hotels and flights. A well-planned itinerary ensures that every member of the familyâ€”from children to grandparentsâ€”has an enjoyable experience.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Choose the Right Destination</b></div><div><br></div><div>Select a destination that offers activities for all age groups. Hill stations like Manali and Kashmir provide scenic beauty, while Goa and Kerala are perfect for relaxing beach vacations.</div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Book Early</b></div><div><br></div><div>Advance booking helps you secure better hotel options, lower airfare, and preferred sightseeing slots.</div><div><br></div><div>Keep the Itinerary Balanced</div><div><br></div><div>Avoid packing too many activities into a single day. Include time for relaxation, shopping, and local cuisine.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Travel Essentials</b></div><div>Carry valid ID proofs.</div><div>Pack medicines and first-aid supplies.</div><div>Keep digital copies of travel documents.</div><div>Purchase travel insurance for added peace of mind.</div><div>Final Thoughts</div><div><br></div><div>A memorable family vacation is all about spending quality time together. Proper planning ensures everyone returns home with wonderful memories.</div>', '../../../images/call_to_action/2026/Jul/01/1782895133/gallery-1.jpg', 0),
(2, 'Top 7 Honeymoon Destinations Every Couple Should Visit', '<div><b>Celebrate Love with an Unforgettable Journey</b></div><div><br></div><div>Your honeymoon is one of life\'s most cherished experiences. Choosing the perfect destination can make it even more special.</div><div><br></div><div><b>1. Maldives</b></div><div><br></div><div>Crystal-clear waters, luxurious water villas, and romantic sunsets.</div><div><br></div><div><b>2. Kashmir</b></div><div><br></div><div>Known as \"Paradise on Earth,\" Kashmir offers breathtaking valleys, snow-capped mountains, and peaceful shikara rides.</div><div><br></div><div><b>3. Bali</b></div><div><br></div><div>A perfect blend of beaches, temples, and luxury resorts.</div><div><br></div><div><b>4. Goa</b></div><div><br></div><div>Ideal for couples who enjoy beaches, nightlife, and Portuguese heritage.</div><div><br></div><div><b>5. Kerala</b></div><div><br></div><div>Houseboats, backwaters, and lush greenery make Kerala a romantic escape.</div><div><br></div><div><b>6. Andaman Islands</b></div><div><br></div><div>Pristine beaches, scuba diving, and peaceful island vibes.</div><div><br></div><div><b>7. Switzerland</b></div><div><br></div><div>A dream destination featuring alpine landscapes, scenic train rides, and charming villages.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Travel Tips</b></div><div><ul><li>Book your honeymoon package early.</li><li>Choose a resort with private experiences.</li><li>Include at least one leisure day with no planned activities.</li><li>Carry all travel documents and travel insurance.</li></ul></div>', '../../../images/call_to_action/2026/Jul/01/1782895112/gallery-4.jpg', 0),
(3, 'Why Booking Through a Travel Agency Saves You Time & Money', '<div><b>Expert Planning Makes Every Journey Better</b></div><div><br></div><div>Many travelers believe booking everything themselves is cheaper. However, experienced travel agencies often provide better value through industry expertise and exclusive partnerships.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Better Hotel Deals</b></div><div><br></div><div>Travel agencies have access to negotiated rates and exclusive offers that may not be available on public booking platforms.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Personalized Itineraries</b></div><div><br></div><div>Instead of generic packages, professionals design itineraries based on your budget, interests, and travel style.</div><div><br></div><div><b>One Point of Contact</b></div><div><br></div><div>Need to change your flight or hotel? Your travel consultant handles the coordination, saving you valuable time.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Emergency Assistance</b></div><div><br></div><div>Unexpected flight cancellations, weather issues, or last-minute changes can happen. A travel agency provides support throughout your journey.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Save Time</b></div><div><br></div><div>No need to compare dozens of websites. An experienced travel consultant prepares the best options for you in one place.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Conclusion</b></div><div><br></div><div>A trusted travel agency helps you enjoy a hassle-free holiday by taking care of planning, bookings, coordination, and supportâ€”allowing you to focus on creating unforgettable memories.</div>', '../../../images/call_to_action/2026/Jul/01/1782895039/gallery-5.jpg', 0);
