(1, '[{\"banner_count\":\"1\",\"image_url\":\"../../../images/banner/2026/Jul/14/1784007517/banner-1.jpg\"},{\"banner_count\":\"2\",\"image_url\":\"../../../images/banner/2026/Jul/14/1784007521/banner-5.jpg\"},{\"banner_count\":\"3\",\"image_url\":\"../../../images/banner/2026/Jul/14/1784007527/banner-25.jpg\"},{\"banner_count\":\"4\",\"image_url\":\"../../../images/banner/2026/Jul/14/1784007548/banner-73.jpg\"}]', '[{\"dest_id\":\"39\",\"package_id\":\"23\",\"url\":\"https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/uae/Asia_UAE_ABU_DHABI_Moreeb_Dune.jpg\"},{\"dest_id\":\"34\",\"package_id\":\"21\",\"url\":\"https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/singapore/Asia_Singapore_East_Coast_Park.jpg\"},{\"dest_id\":\"1\",\"package_id\":\"3\",\"url\":\"https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/andaman_and_nicobar_islands/Asia_India_Andaman_and_Nicobar_Islands_South_Andaman_Island.jpg\"},{\"dest_id\":\"9\",\"package_id\":\"1\",\"url\":\"https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/kerela/Asia_India_Kerela_Chinnar_wildlife_sanctuary.jpg\"},{\"dest_id\":\"6\",\"package_id\":\"9\",\"url\":\"https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/himachal_pradesh/Asia_India_HP_Kullu.jpg\"},{\"dest_id\":\"5\",\"package_id\":\"7\",\"url\":\"https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/gujarat/Asia_India_Gujrat_Valsad.jpg\"}]', '[{\"dest_id\":\"17\",\"tour_id\":\"1\",\"url\":\"https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/uttarakhand/Asia_India_Uttakhand_Kedarnath.jpg\"},{\"dest_id\":\"39\",\"tour_id\":\"2\",\"url\":\"https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/uae/Asia_UAE_DUBAI_Deira_Clocktower.jpg\"}]', '[{\"city_id\":\"400\",\"hotel_id\":\"95\"},{\"city_id\":\"1996\",\"hotel_id\":\"89\"},{\"city_id\":\"1854\",\"hotel_id\":\"152\"},{\"city_id\":\"1944\",\"hotel_id\":\"883\"}]', '[{\"city_id\":\"1961\",\"exc_id\":\"55\"},{\"city_id\":\"1827\",\"exc_id\":\"102\"},{\"city_id\":\"9908\",\"exc_id\":\"75\"}]', '', '', '[{\"dest_id\":\"4\",\"package_id\":\"5\"},{\"dest_id\":\"9\",\"package_id\":\"1\"},{\"dest_id\":\"1\",\"package_id\":\"4\"}]', '<ul><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">In the event of cancellation of tour / travel services due to any avoidable / unavoidable reason/s </span>we must be notifed of the same in writing.</li><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Cancellation charges will be effective from the date we receive advice in </span>writing, and cancellation charges would be as follows:</li><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">45 days prior to arrival: 10% of the Tour / service cost</span></li><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">15 days prior to arrival: 25% of the Tour / service cost</span></li><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">07 days prior to arrival: 50% of the Tour / service cost</span></li><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">48 hours prior to arrival OR No Show: No Refund</span></li></ul>', '<div>**Last Updated:** June 30, 2026</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you for choosing our travel services. We strive to provide the best travel experience for our customers. Please read our refund policy carefully before making a booking.</div><div><br></div><div><b># 1. Booking Confirmation</b></div><div><br></div><div>A booking is confirmed only after receipt of the required advance payment and issuance of the booking confirmation.</div><div><br></div><div><b># 2. Cancellation by Customer</b></div><div><br></div><div>If you wish to cancel your booking, cancellation charges will apply based on the time remaining before the departure date.</div><div><br></div><div>| Cancellation Period&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; | Cancellation Charges&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;|</div><div>| ---------------------------------- | -------------------------------- |</div><div>| More than 30 days before departure | 10% of the total booking amount&nbsp; |</div><div>| 15â€“30 days before departure&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; | 30% of the total booking amount&nbsp; |</div><div>| 7â€“14 days before departure&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| 50% of the total booking amount&nbsp; |</div><div>| Less than 7 days before departure&nbsp; | 100% of the total booking amount |</div><div><br></div><div>*Some hotels, airlines, cruises, visas, and special packages may have separate cancellation policies. Their terms will override the above policy.*</div><div><br></div><div><b># 3. Non-Refundable Services</b></div><div><br></div><div>The following charges are generally non-refundable:</div><div><br></div><div>* Visa fees</div><div>* Travel insurance</div><div>* Flight tickets (as per airline rules)</div><div>* Hotel bookings marked as Non-Refundable</div><div>* Government taxes and service charges</div><div>* Processing or convenience fees</div><div><br></div><div><b># 4. Refund Processing</b></div><div><br></div><div>Approved refunds will be processed within **7â€“15 working days** after receiving confirmation from hotels, airlines, or other suppliers.</div><div><br></div><div>Refunds will be credited through the original mode of payment.</div><div><br></div><div><b># 5. Cancellation by Us</b></div><div><br></div><div>In the rare event that we cancel a tour due to operational reasons, natural disasters, government restrictions, or unforeseen circumstances, customers will be offered:</div><div><br></div><div>* Alternative travel dates,</div><div>* Travel credit, or</div><div>* Refund as per supplier policies.</div><div><br></div><div><b># 6. Force Majeure</b></div><div><br></div><div>We shall not be liable for cancellations or delays caused by circumstances beyond our control, including but not limited to:</div><div><br></div><div>* Natural disasters</div><div>* Pandemics</div><div>* Political unrest</div><div>* War</div><div>* Flight cancellations</div><div>* Government regulations</div><div>* Weather conditions</div><div><br></div><div>Refunds in such cases will depend on the policies of airlines, hotels, and other service providers.</div><div><br></div><div><b># 7. Contact</b></div><div><br></div><div>For refund-related queries, please contact our customer support team through the contact information available on our website.</div>', '<div>**Last Updated:** June 30, 2026</div><div><br></div><div>Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect your personal information.</div><div><br></div><div><b># Information We Collect</b></div><div><br></div><div>We may collect:</div><div><br></div><div>* Name</div><div>* Mobile Number</div><div>* Email Address</div><div>* Postal Address</div><div>* Date of Birth (where required)</div><div>* Passport information (for international travel)</div><div>* Payment information</div><div>* Travel preferences</div><div>* Device information</div><div>* IP address</div><div>* Website usage data</div><div><br></div><div><b># How We Use Your Information</b></div><div><br></div><div>We use your information to:</div><div><br></div><div>* Process travel bookings</div><div>* Generate quotations</div><div>* Confirm reservations</div><div>* Send travel updates</div><div>* Provide customer support</div><div>* Improve our services</div><div>* Send promotional offers (with your consent)</div><div>* Comply with legal obligations</div><div><br></div><div><b># Payment Security</b></div><div><br></div><div>Online payments are processed through secure payment gateways. We do not store your complete debit or credit card information on our servers.</div><div><br></div><div><b># Information Sharing</b></div><div><br></div><div>We may share your information only with:</div><div><br></div><div>* Airlines</div><div>* Hotels</div><div>* Transport providers</div><div>* Visa partners</div><div>* Insurance providers</div><div>* Government authorities (where legally required)</div><div><br></div><div>We never sell your personal information to third parties.</div><div><br></div><div><b># Cookies</b></div><div><br></div><div>Our website may use cookies to improve user experience, remember preferences, and analyze website traffic.</div><div><br></div><div>You can disable cookies through your browser settings.</div><div><br></div><div><b># Data Protection</b></div><div><br></div><div>We implement reasonable technical and organizational security measures to protect your personal information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.</div><div><br></div><div><b># Marketing Communication</b></div><div><br></div><div>You may receive promotional emails, WhatsApp messages, or SMS if you have opted in. You can unsubscribe at any time.</div><div><br></div><div><b># Your Rights</b></div><div><br></div><div>You may request to:</div><div><br></div><div>* Access your personal data</div><div>* Correct inaccurate information</div><div>* Delete your information (subject to legal requirements)</div><div>* Withdraw marketing consent</div><div><br></div><div><b># Children\'s Privacy</b></div><div><br></div><div>Our services are not intended for children under 18 years without parental or guardian consent.</div><div><br></div><div><b># Policy Updates</b></div><div><br></div><div>We reserve the right to modify this Privacy Policy at any time. Updated versions will be published on this website.</div><div><br></div><div><b># Contact</b></div><div><br></div><div>For any privacy-related questions, please contact us using the contact details available on our website.</div>', '<div>**Last Updated:** June 30, 2026</div><div><br></div><div>Welcome to our website. By accessing or using this website, you agree to comply with these Terms of Use.</div><div><br></div><div><b># Acceptance of Terms</b></div><div><br></div><div>By using our website or booking any travel service, you agree to these Terms and Conditions.</div><div><br></div><div><b># Booking Responsibility</b></div><div><br></div><div>Customers are responsible for providing accurate personal and travel information during booking.</div><div><br></div><div>Incorrect information may result in booking failure, visa rejection, or denied travel.</div><div><br></div><div><b># Pricing</b></div><div><br></div><div>All prices displayed are subject to availability and may change without prior notice until the booking is confirmed.</div><div><br></div><div><b># Travel Documents</b></div><div><br></div><div>Customers are solely responsible for ensuring they possess:</div><div><br></div><div>* Valid Passport</div><div>* Visa</div><div>* Required Identification</div><div>* Travel Insurance (where applicable)</div><div>* Vaccination certificates (if required)</div><div><br></div><div><b># Supplier Responsibility</b></div><div><br></div><div>Flights, hotels, cruises, transport services, and sightseeing are provided by independent suppliers.</div><div><br></div><div>We act as a facilitator and are not responsible for service failures caused by third-party providers.</div><div><br></div><div><b># Website Content</b></div><div><br></div><div>All website content including text, images, graphics, logos, itineraries, and designs are protected by copyright.</div><div><br></div><div>Unauthorized copying, reproduction, or commercial use is prohibited.</div><div><br></div><div><b># User Conduct</b></div><div><br></div><div>Users agree not to:</div><div><br></div><div>* Use the website for unlawful purposes</div><div>* Attempt unauthorized access</div><div>* Upload malicious software</div><div>* Submit false information</div><div>* Violate intellectual property rights</div><div><br></div><div><b># Limitation of Liability</b></div><div><br></div><div>We shall not be liable for:</div><div><br></div><div>* Flight delays or cancellations</div><div>* Hotel overbookings</div><div>* Visa refusals</div><div>* Loss of baggage</div><div>* Personal injuries</div><div>* Natural disasters</div><div>* Political disturbances</div><div>* Acts beyond our reasonable control</div><div><br></div><div><b># Third-Party Links</b></div><div><br></div><div>Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for their content or privacy practices.</div><div><br></div><div><b># Governing Law</b></div><div><br></div><div>These Terms shall be governed by the laws of India. Any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts where our registered office is located.</div><div><br></div><div><b># Changes to Terms</b></div><div><br></div><div>We reserve the right to update these Terms at any time without prior notice. Continued use of the website constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.</div><div><br></div><div><b># Contact</b></div><div><br></div><div>For any questions regarding these Terms of Use, please contact our support team through the contact information provided on our website.</div>', '[{\"fb\":\"www.facebook.com\",\"tw\":\"www.x.com\",\"li\":\"www.linkedin.com\",\"wa\":\"www.whatsapp.com\",\"yu\":\"www.youtube.com\",\"inst\":\"www.instagram.com\"}]', 'Monday To Saturday 10:00 AM To 7:00 PM', '', '', '', '', '', '[\"1\",\"3\",\"6\",\"9\",\"19\",\"22\",\"55\"]', '', '', '[{\"title\":\"Industry Expertise\",\"description\":\"Over 7 years of experience in delivering seamless travel solutions.\"},{\"title\":\"Comprehensive Services\",\"description\":\"From flights to hotels, tours to visas u2014 everything in one place.\"},{\"title\":\"Trusted Network\",\"description\":\"Partnerships with leading travel suppliers worldwide.\"},{\"title\":\"Innovative Solutions\",\"description\":\"Modern travel technology for faster, smarter bookings.\"},{\"title\":\"Experienced Team\",\"description\":\"Passionate professionals dedicated to crafting perfect trips.\"},{\"title\":\"Global Reach\",\"description\":\"Serving clients across India, Dubai, Oman, Thailand & more.\"}]', '[{\"service_name\":\"Hotel Bookings\",\"description\":\"Access a wide range of hotels worldwide at the best prices with instant confirmations.\"},{\"service_name\":\"Flight Reservations\",\"description\":\"Hassle-free domestic and international flight bookings with competitive fares.\"},{\"service_name\":\"Visa Assistance\",\"description\":\"Complete support for travel visa applications, documentation, and approvals.\"},{\"service_name\":\"Cruise Holidays\",\"description\":\"Experience luxury on water with top cruise lines and exciting destinations.\"},{\"service_name\":\"Travel Insurance\",\"description\":\"Comprehensive coverage to protect you against unexpected travel issues.\"},{\"service_name\":\"Adventure Activities\",\"description\":\"Book thrilling adventures like trekking, scuba diving, safaris, and more.\"}]');
