(68, 68, 'Checklist reminder', '<div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b>Dear {name},</b></span></font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Thank you for choosing us for your exciting vacation with your family or friends. We assure you the best of the services to ensure that you simply enjoy the tour, create cherishing memories & leave all the worries about making your tour a great one to us.</span></font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">For your highest convenience we are happy to provide you access to our system wherein you can check our upcoming offers, download various documents like Service Vouchers, Invoices, Air Tickets Booked through us, etc. With this we hope that you travel along with us, when it comes to create cherished memories and lasting experience.</span></font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Wishing you All the Best!</span></font></div></div>', '<table width=\"90%\" align=\"center\" role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px auto;margin-top:20px; min-width: 100%;\">                                                            <tbody><tr>                                                               <td>                                                                     <table width=\"100%\" align=\"center\" role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px auto;margin-top:20px; min-width: 100%;\">                                                                           <tbody><tr align=\"left\"><td style=\"text-align=left;\"><i style=\"font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size:small; background-color:= rgb(255,255,255);\">Warm Regards</i></td></tr><tr>                                                                     </tr></tbody></table>                                                               </td>                                           \n        \n         </tr></tbody></table>', 'Active'),
