ements.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos;mso-hansi-font-family:\nAptos;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-no-proof:yes\"><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shape\n id=\"_x0000_i1027\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\" style=\'width:8.4pt;height:8.4pt;\n visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:square\'>\n <v:imagedata src=\"file:///C:/Users/IWS/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.png\"\n  o:title=\"\"></v:imagedata>\n</v:shape><![endif]--><!--[if !vml]--><img width=\"11\" height=\"11\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" v:shapes=\"_x0000_i1027\"><!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family:\nAptos;mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri\">&nbsp; Cost of\ninsurance for 60 years and above<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos;mso-hansi-font-family:\nAptos;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-no-proof:yes\"><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shape\n id=\"_x0000_i1026\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\" style=\'width:8.4pt;height:8.4pt;\n visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:square\'>\n <v:imagedata src=\"file:///C:/Users/IWS/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.png\"\n  o:title=\"\"></v:imagedata>\n</v:shape><![endif]--><!--[if !vml]--><img width=\"11\" height=\"11\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" v:shapes=\"_x0000_i1026\"><!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family:\nAptos;mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri\">&nbsp;Porterage,\nlaundry, telephone charges, shopping, wines &amp; alcoholic beverages.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos;mso-hansi-font-family:\nAptos;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-no-proof:yes\"><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shape\n id=\"Picture_x0020_4\" o:spid=\"_x0000_i1025\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\" style=\'width:8.4pt;\n height:8.4pt;visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:square\'>\n <v:imagedata src=\"file:///C:/Users/IWS/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.png\"\n  o:title=\"\"></v:imagedata>\n</v