(23, 2, 'The Dhyana Buddha statue is a statue of a Buddha in Amaravathi, India.', 'https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/andhra_pradesh/Asia_India_AP_Amaravati.jpg'),
(24, 2, ' ISKCON temple is in the shape of a horse drawn chariot, with statues of 4 huge horses in front.', 'https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/andhra_pradesh/Asia_India_AP_Anantapur.jpg'),
(25, 2, 'Annavaram is one of the most famous Holy Shrines in India and enjoying second place after Tirupati.', 'https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/andhra_pradesh/Asia_India_AP_Annavaram.jpg'),
(26, 2, 'Araku Valley is a hill station surrounded by the thick forests of the Eastern Ghats mountain range. ', 'https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/andhra_pradesh/Asia_India_AP_araku_valley.jpg'),
(27, 2, 'Chandragiri Fort, a historical fort, built in the 11th century in Chandragiri, in Andhra Pradesh.', 'https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/andhra_pradesh/Asia_India_AP_Chandragiri.jpg'),
(28, 2, 'Horsley Hills is an enthralling, charming little hill station in Andra Pradesh.', 'https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/andhra_pradesh/Asia_India_AP_Horsley_Hills.jpg'),
(29, 2, 'The Charminar, is a historical place with mosque on top floor since 425 years.', 'https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/andhra_pradesh/Asia_India_AP_Hyderabad.jpg'),
(30, 2, 'Pithapuram is often referred to as Dakshin Kashi, is home to Sri Surya Ayurvedic Nilayam.', 'https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/andhra_pradesh/Asia_India_AP_Kakinada.jpg'),
(31, 2, 'Kurnool District is one of the 13 districts in the state of Andhra Pradesh, India.', 'https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/andhra_pradesh/Asia_India_AP_Kurnool.jpg'),
(32, 2, ' Lepakshi is archaeologically significant, dedicated to Shiva, Vishnu and Veerabhadra.', 'https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/andhra_pradesh/Asia_India_AP_Lepakshi.jpg'),
(33, 2, 'Lord Narasimha and Lord Panakala Narasimha Swamy temple located on the top of the Mangalgiri hill.', 'https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/andhra_pradesh/Asia_India_AP_Mangalagiri.jpg'),
(34, 2, 'Nagalapuram falls is located near Arai village in Chittoor district.Famous for waterfalls trekking.', 'https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/andhra_pradesh/Asia_India_AP_Nagalapuram.jpg'),
(35, 2, 'Sri Ranganathaswamy Temple, get a devotional feel while entering in to the temple premises.', 'https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/andhra_pradesh/Asia_India_AP_Nellore.jpg'),
(36, 2, 'Puttaparthi , has given birth to one such prophet, Sri Satya Sai Baba.', 'https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/andhra_pradesh/Asia_India_AP_Puttaparthi.jpg'),
(37, 2, 'Located on the bank of Godavari river. Place for devotion, Usually crowded on Krishna astami.', 'https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/andhra_pradesh/Asia_India_AP_Rajahmundry.jpg'),
(38, 2, 'Andhra Pradesh ', 'https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/andhra_pradesh/Asia_India_AP_Ramoji_Film_City.jpg'),
(39, 2, 'Srikalahasti is a holy town in Chittoor district of the Indian state of Andhra Pradesh.', 'https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/andhra_pradesh/Asia_India_AP_Srikalahasti.jpg'),
(40, 2, 'The ancient world famous Chintala Venkataramana Temple over 5 acre area is located in Tadipatri.', 'https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/andhra_pradesh/Asia_India_AP_Tadipatri.jpg'),
(41, 2, 'Tirupati Venkateswara Temple is one of the most popular temple  visited by a number of visitors.', 'https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/andhra_pradesh/Asia_India_AP_Tirumala.jpg'),
