(67, 4, 'Bogmalo Beach is a small beach-side village in Goa. Situated in a bay with curving sandy beach.', 'https://itourscloud.com/destination_gallery/asia/india/goa/Asia_India_Goa_Bogmalo_Beach.jpg'),
