re\'>\n <v:imagedata src=\"file:///C:/Users/IWS/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.png\"\n  o:title=\"\"></v:imagedata>\n</v:shape><![endif]--><!--[if !vml]--><img width=\"11\" height=\"11\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" v:shapes=\"Picture_x0020_4\"><!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family:\nAptos;mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri\">&nbsp; Anything\nspecifically not mentioned in the tour price includes column<o:p></o:p></span></p><br><br>', '<span class=\"fontstyle0\"><b><br>Booking Amount And Final Payment:</b><br><ul><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">We require a minimum deposit as booking amounts as per the below chart per person at the timeÂ </span>of booking.</li><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Your service provider will require amounts towards the bookings which amounts are nonrefundable,Â </span>non-transferable and interest free amounts.</li><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Final payment for the relevant booking is required no later than 6 weeks prior to departure unlessÂ </span>otherwise stated on your invoice.</li><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Some airfares or services must be paid in full at the time of booking.</span></li></ul></span><span class=\"fontstyle0\"><br></span><div><span class=\"fontstyle0\"><b>Cancellation Policy:</b><br><ul><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">In the event of cancellation of tour / travel services due to any avoidable / unavoidable reason/s</span></li><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">we must beÂ </span>notified of the same in writing.</li><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Cancellation charges will be effective from the date we receive advice inÂ </span>writing, and cancellation charges would be as follows:</li><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">45 days prior to arrival: 10% of the Tour / service cost</span></li><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">15 days prior to arrival: 25% of the Tour / service cost</span></li><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">07 days prior to arrival: 50% of the Tour / service cost</span></li><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">48 hours prior to arrival OR No Show: No Refund</span></li></ul></span><span class=\"fontstyle0\"><br></span></div><div><span class=\"fontstyle0\"><b>Foreign Exchange:</b><br><ul><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Foreign Exchange utilization for the purpose of Land arrangements/ self use will be done from theÂ </span>individual BTQ Quota only.</li><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Payments will be accepted in accordance with the rules and regulations laid down by ReserveÂ </span>Bank of India.</li><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">You shall be required to provide such KYC documents as may be requested by Travel Tours at theÂ </span>time of booking/ receiving the booking amounts.</li></ul></span><span class=\"fontstyle0\"><br><b>Booking Amendments :</b><br><ul><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">If you wish to transfer from one trip to another or transfer your booking to a third party you mustÂ </span>notify us at least 40 days prior to the departure date.</li><li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">No charges are applied.</span></li></ul></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><br><i>NoteÂ </i>: This is only a quotation. No booking is made yet. The costing may differ as per availability.</span></div>', 1, '2026-07-03', 1, 1, 1, '', '', '[{\"basic\":\"\",\"service\":\"\",\"markup\":\"\",\"discount\":\"\",\"tax_apply_on\":\"3\",\"tax_value\":\"CGST:(9.00%):(21)+SGST:(9.00%):(119)\",\"tcsper\":\"20\",\"tcsvalue\":\"4613.80\"}]', 68, 1, '+91', '8622971825', 0, 0.00);
