(1, 1268, 'Hotel Blue Waves', '+nLvKkvdP4jqlQ==', '1111111111', 'pye7cz2Mfs++xa1MPVUUtP/PEIDU', '', 'pye7cz2Mfs++xa1MPVUUtP/PEIDU', 'Mr. Sam', '9096685012', 'B Wings, Teerth Technospace, Mumbai Bangalore Highway, Baner, Pune-411021', 'www.hotelexample.com', 0.00, '3 Star', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Active', 3, 'Credit', '', '1970-01-01', 'A comfortable and well-appointed hotel offering modern amenities and warm hospitality for a pleasant stay. Conveniently located, it provides easy access to key attractions and business hubs. Ideal for both leisure and business travelers seeking comfort, convenience, and value.', 'Booking Amount And Final Payment:\nWe require a minimum deposit as booking amounts as per the below chart per person at the time\nof\nbooking.\nYour service provider will require amounts towards the bookings which amounts are nonrefundable,\nnon-transferable and interest free amounts.\nFinal payment for the relevant booking is required no later than 6 weeks prior to departure unless\notherwise stated on your invoice.\nSome airfares or services must be paid in full at the time of booking.', '', 5, 11, 1, 4, '', 0, '', '', ''),
