(123, 23, 11, 'Arrive Srinagar', 'Arrival at Srinagar Airport. The vehicle to the hotel departs from Srinagar Airport. Guests are requested to time their flights as per this schedule to avail the complimentary transfers or else they may opt for the add-on transfers on extra payment basis. Reach your hotel. Check in and freshen up. In Evening Enjoy Shikara ride on Dal Lake.', 'Srinagar', '', 'crm/uploads/quotation_images/day_1_quotation_23_package_11_day_1_1783493219.jpg', 1),
(124, 23, 11, 'Srinagar- Pahalgam', 'Today after an early breakfast Visit Shankaracharya Temple situated on top of the Shankaracharya Hill on the Zabarwan Range in Srinagar, Jammu and Kashmir, India.\n\nArrive Pahalgam and transfer to your hotel. Rest of the day is at leisure.', 'Pahalgam', '', 'crm/uploads/quotation_images/day_2_quotation_23_package_11_day_2_1783493219.jpg', 2),
(125, 23, 11, 'Pahalgam - Gulmarg', 'Today after breakfast enjoy a picturesque drive to Gulmarg. You may enjoy an optional sledge ride or Cable car ride on the snow covered slopes (on direct payment basis)', 'Gulmarg', '', 'crm/uploads/quotation_images/day_3_quotation_23_package_11_day_3_1783493219.jpg', 3),
(126, 23, 11, 'Gulmarg - Srinagar', 'After breakfast You Can Enjoy Gulmarg Gondola , Asia\'s largest and highest and world\'s second-largest and second highest cable car project, Gulmarg Gondola is the top attraction in Gulmarg. In fact, a Gulmarg tour without a ride on the popular cable car is considered incomplete.', 'Tour End', '', 'crm/uploads/quotation_images/day_4_quotation_23_package_11_day_4_1783493219.jpg', 4),
(127, 22, 11, 'Shikara Ride, Mughal Gardens', 'Pickup from Srinagar Airport. Transfer to Hotel / Houseboat. Evening Shikara Ride on Dal Lake. Visit Mughal Gardens (Nishat Bagh & Shalimar Bagh).', 'Srinagar', 'B+D', '', 1),
(128, 22, 11, 'Gondola Ride, Snow activities, Gulmarg Sightseeing', 'Morning drive to Gulmarg. Gondola Ride (optional). Snow activities & sightseeing. Return to Srinagar.', 'Srinagar', 'B+D', '', 2),
(129, 22, 11, 'Saffron Fields, Avantipura Ruins, Aru Valley, Betaab Valley', 'Drive to Pahalgam. Enroute Saffron Fields & Avantipura Ruins. Visit Aru Valley / Betaab Valley (optional).', 'Pahalgam', 'B+D', '', 3),
(130, 22, 11, 'Lal Chowk Market Shopping', 'Breakfast at hotel. Return to Srinagar. Free time for shopping (Lal Chowk Market).', 'Srinagar', 'B+D', '', 4),
(131, 22, 11, 'Thajiwas Glacier, Himalayan Views', 'Day trip to Sonmarg. Visit Thajiwas Glacier (pony ride optional). Scenic Himalayan views. Return to Srinagar.', 'Srinagar', 'B+D', '', 5),
(132, 22, 11, 'Departure Transfer', 'Breakfast at hotel. Transfer to Srinagar Airport. Tour ends with beautiful memories of Kashmir.', 'Tour End', 'Breakfast', '', 6),
(133, 24, 23, 'Arrive DubaiTime at Leisure', 'On arrival at Dubai International Airport, you\'ll be transferred to your hotel. Upon arrival check in to the hotel and relax. ', 'Dubai', '', 'crm/uploads/quotation_images/day_1_quotation_24_package_23_day_1_1783496547.jpg', 1),
(134, 24, 23, 'Dubai: Morning at Leisure; Evening Dhow Cruise with Dinner', 'Enjoy breakfast at the hotel.\n\nIn the evening get ready to experience the Dhow Cruise. Cruising down Dubai creek is a novel experience, one which you cannot miss when in Dubai. Having fancy dinner on a Dhow Cruise with the fascinating lights of Dubai Creek and the soft music in the background, sip your favorite drink and enjoy a buffet dinner on board the cruise.', 'Dubai', '', 'crm/uploads/quotation_images/day_2_quotation_24_package_23_day_2_1783496547.jpg', 2),
(135, 24, 23, 'Dubai Half Day City Tour  Followed By At the Top Burj Khalifa', 'After breakfast, proceed for a half day morning city tour, viewing some of the city most beautiful landmarks. The Magnificent Jumeriah Mosque built in 1979 is a fine example of modern Islamic architecture.\n\nYouï¿½ll be dropped back to Dubai Mall. You can use this time to have your lunch\n\nTake a closer look at the world below through avant-garde, high powered, telescopes. Step out onto the world\'s highest public outdoor observation terrace overlooking the ever growing skyline of Sheikh Zayed Road and surrounding panorama.\n\nReturn to hotel for a comfortable overnight stay.', 'Dubai', '', 'crm/uploads/quotation_images/day_3_quotation_24_package_23_day_3_1783496547.jpg', 3),
(136, 24, 23, 'Dubai Departure', 'Today enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Later check out and Transfer to Dubai airport for your departure flight. We hope you take back many happy memories of your holiday.', 'Tour End', '', 'crm/uploads/quotation_images/day_4_quotation_24_package_23_day_4_1783496547.jpg', 4),
(137, 25, 32, 'Arrive Port Blair-Cellular Jail-Light & Sound Show', 'On arrive at <b>Port Blair airport</b>, our representative will receive and escorted to the hotel. After check-in at the hotel and little relax, we proceed to covers Cellular Jail (National Memorial), and after Light & Sound Show at <b>Cellular Jail</b>: At evening, we move for the Light and Sound Show at Cellular Jail where the saga of the freedom struggle brought alive.<b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b>', 'Port blair', '', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251226_055423_7c429756_Day1.webp', 1),
(138, 25, 32, 'Port Blair-Havelock Island-Radhanagar Beach', 'Today, we start our journey towards<b> Havelock island</b> via ferry from Port Blair Harbor. On arrival at Havelock Island, our representative will receive and escort you to check-in to the resort. Later we proceed to <b>Radhanagar Beach</b> (Beach No. 7), the Times Magazine rated the finest beach among the best beaches in Asia. It is an ideal place for swimming, sea bathing and basking on the sun kissed beach.<b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b>', 'Havelock Island', '', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251226_055424_49217ec2_DAy2.webp', 2),
(139, 25, 32, 'Havelock Island Sightseeing', 'After breakfast, day free at <b>Havelock Island </b>for own leisure activities.<b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b>', 'Havelock Island', '', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251226_055424_e76eb97c_Day3.webp', 3),
(140, 25, 32, 'Joyful trip to North Bay island', '<b>North Bay</b> (Coral Island): From Ross Island, we proceed for a joyful trip to North Bay island (Coral Island) offering exotic coral, colorful fishes and underwater marine life. We can view these colorful corals & underwater marine life via in glass bottom boat and Snorkeling (optional).<b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b>', 'North Bay island', '', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251226_055425_70d67142_Day11.webp', 4),
(141, 25, 32, 'Day at Leisure. We do nothing-We Just relax.', 'Day at leisure. How, about relaxing in the lap of nature? Today, you can relax and spend the day enjoying white sand beaches. Additional activities such as <b>Scuba Diving</b> and Sea Walk can be done on this day.<b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b>', 'Port blair', '', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251226_055425_cd86b1a0_Day12.webp', 5),
(142, 25, 32, 'Depart from Port Blair Islands', 'Drop to Port Blair for Return journey.', 'Tour Ends', '', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251226_055425_65997abf_Day13.webp', 6),
(143, 26, 24, 'Arrive Dubai Time at Leisure', 'On arrival at Dubai International Airport, you\'ll be transferred to your hotel. Upon arrival check in to the hotel and relax. ', 'Dubai', '', '', 1),
(144, 26, 24, 'Dubai: Morning at Leisure; Evening Dhow Cruise with Dinner', 'Enjoy breakfast at the hotel.\n\nIn the evening get ready to experience the Dhow Cruise. Cruising down Dubai creek is a novel experience, one which you cannot miss when in Dubai. Having fancy dinner on a Dhow Cruise with the fascinating lights of Dubai Creek and the soft music in the background, sip your favorite drink and enjoy a buffet dinner on board the cruise.', 'Dubai', '', '', 2),
(145, 26, 24, 'Dubai Half Day City Tour  Followed By At the Top Burj Khalifa', 'After breakfast, proceed for a half day morning city tour, viewing some of the city most beautiful landmarks. The Magnificent Jumeriah Mosque built in 1979 is a fine example of modern Islamic architecture.\n\nYouï¿½ll be dropped back to Dubai Mall. You can use this time to have your lunch\n\nTake a closer look at the world below through avant-garde, high powered, telescopes. Step out onto the world\'s highest public outdoor observation terrace overlooking the ever growing skyline of Sheikh Zayed Road and surrounding panorama.\n\nReturn to hotel for a comfortable overnight stay.', 'Dubai', '', '', 3),
(146, 26, 24, 'Dubai-Abu Dhabi City Tour with a visit to Sheikh Zayed  Grand  Mosque', 'After breakfast, check out from your hotel in Dubai and proceed towards Abu Dhabi. \n\nAbu Dhabi, the capital of the UAE, is a gem to discover.\n\nProceed for an Abu Dhabi city tour, Abu Dhabi is the largest of the seven Emirates. Explore the majesty of the Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque.\nVisit Ferrari World or Yas Waterworld, Yas Waterworld, Warner Bros Park. After spending time at the park return to hotel for a comfortable overnight stay. ', 'Abu Dhabi', '', '', 4),
(147, 26, 24, 'Dubai Departure', 'Today enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Later check out and Transfer to Dubai airport for your departure flight. We hope you take back many happy memories of your holiday.', 'Tour End', '', '', 5),
(148, 27, 4, 'Arrival at Port Blair', 'Arrive at Port Blair and you will be taken to your hotel where you relax and rest and after lunch proceed for local sightseeing of Port Blair. Later you will be taken to Cellular Jail (closed on Mondays) to enjoy beautiful Light and Sound show. Evening is free for leisure activities.', 'Port Blair', '', 'crm/uploads/quotation_images/day_1_quotation_27_package_4_day_1_1783574442.jpg', 1),
(149, 27, 4, 'Port Blair to Havelock', 'Morning we go to Corbyns Cove Beach the most active beach side of Port Blair. We start our journey towards Havelock Island via ferry from Port Blair Harbor. On arrival at Havelock Island, our representative will receive and escort you to check-in to the resort. After relax, day free for own leisure at Havelock Island.', 'Havelock', '', 'crm/uploads/quotation_images/day_2_quotation_27_package_4_day_2_1783574442.jpg', 2),
(150, 27, 4, 'Havelock - Radhanagar Beach and Kalapathar Beach', 'After breakfast day free for own leisure, afternoon we proceed to Radhanagar Beach, the Times Magazine rated the finest beach among the best beaches in Asia. It is an ideal place for swimming, sea bathing and basking on the sun kissed beaches. Later Visit the Kalapathar Beach for its blue waters.', 'Havelock', '', 'crm/uploads/quotation_images/day_3_quotation_27_package_4_day_3_1783574442.jpg', 3),
(151, 27, 4, 'Havelock - Neil Island', 'After buffet breakfast, check out from the hotel. Transfer to the Havelock jetty to board the ferry for Neil Island. Post lunch (on direct payment), proceed to visit Bharatpur beach, Laxmanpur beach and Howrah Bridge (depending on tide conditions).  Return to the hotel in the evening. Enjoy your dinner and a comfortable overnight stay at the hotel.', 'Neil Island', '', 'crm/uploads/quotation_images/day_4_quotation_27_package_4_day_4_1783574442.jpg', 4),
(152, 27, 4, 'Neil Island- Port Blair', 'This morning after breakfast you will transfer to Port Blair airport in time to board your flight. Depart Port Blair with fond memories of these mesmerizing Islands.', 'Tour End', '', 'crm/uploads/quotation_images/day_5_quotation_27_package_4_day_5_1783574442.jpg', 5),
(153, 28, 0, 'Arrival Transfer', 'Arrival at Bangkok Airport and private transfer to Pattaya hotel. Check-in at Golden Beach Pattaya Hotel.', 'Pattaya', 'Breakfast', '', 1),
(154, 28, 0, 'Coral Island Tour, Alcazar Show', 'Enjoy Coral Island Tour by speed boat with Indian buffet lunch. In the evening, experience the Alcazar Show with private transfers and a soft drink.', 'Pattaya', 'B+L', '', 2),
(155, 28, 0, 'Nong Nooch Garden, Sightseeing', 'Visit Nong Nooch Garden including admission, show, Indian buffet lunch, and sightseeing bus with private transfer by van.', 'Pattaya', 'B+L', '', 3),
(156, 28, 0, 'Pattaya to Bangkok Transfer, Chao Phraya Princess Cruise', 'Private transfer from Pattaya hotel to Bangkok hotel. Check-in at Ecotel Bangkok Hotel. In the evening, enjoy Chao Phraya Princess Cruise Dinner.', 'Bangkok', 'B+D', '', 4),
(157, 28, 0, 'Safari World & Marine Park', 'Full day visit to Safari World & Marine Park with lunch on private transfer by van. (Note: Safari World is closed on Monday).', 'Bangkok', 'B+L', '', 5),
(158, 28, 0, 'Departure Transfer', 'Private transfer from Bangkok hotel to Bangkok Airport for departure.', 'Tour End', 'Breakfast', '', 6),
(159, 29, 29, 'On arrival in Dubai Airport', 'On arrival in Dubai check-in to your hotel. Later Proceed to <b>Dubai Marina Cruise</b> it is a sight to behold and cruising through the canal beside it promises unparalleled views of the buildings that have become landmarks on the international map. Among the many sights you will pass by, some that you should not miss are the Burj Al Arab, Hotel Atlantis the Palm, Palm Jumeirah, Dubai Marina Yatch Club Promenade, and the Dubai Marina Mall. You will also get a chance to admire the unique architecture that surrounds the area in form of residential buildings, recreational spaces, and office buildings in evening or in night-time cruise you can see New Dubai glittering under the dark sky. Enjoy <b>Marina Dhow Cruise </b>with delicious dinner.<b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b>', 'Dubai', 'Breakfast', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251229_094918_f3684f57_Day-1.webp', 1);
INSERT INTO `package_quotation_program` (`id`, `quotation_id`, `package_id`, `attraction`, `day_wise_program`, `stay`, `meal_plan`, `day_image`, `day_count`) VALUES
(160, 29, 29, 'Half Day Dubai City Tour & Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner', 'Today after breakfast you will get an opportunity to get acquainted with Dubai city Tour Visit to Dubais famous landmarks such as the sail-shaped <b>Burj Al-Arab </b>hotel and beautiful Jumeirah Mosque, and learn interesting details about each attraction from a local guide. Take in views of the citys most picturesque palaces and residential areas, and venture into<b> Bastakiya</b>, Dubais inspiring old quarter. Cross Dubai Creek by abra (water taxi) and visit the Spice Soul. Vening<b> Enjoy Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner & Belly Dancing</b>.<b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b>', 'Dubai', 'Breakfast', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251229_094918_457607b9_Day-2.webp', 2),
(161, 29, 29, 'Miracle Garden, Desert Safari with Belly dance show', 'Today we visit <b>Miracle Garden</b> (if operational) -This is the largest natural flower garden in the world. After that we enjoy thrilling <b>Desert Safari </b>by four wheeled drive Land Cruiser through Sand dunes followed by amazing Belly Dance show along with Dinner.<b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b>', 'Dubai', 'Breakfast', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251229_094918_0cce145a_Day-4.webp', 3),
(162, 29, 29, 'Abu Dhabi City tour-Ferrari World', 'Today after breakfast proceed for <b>Abu Dhabi city tour</b> with Ferrari world , the leading seasonal cultural extravaganza in the region and one of the best things to do in Dubai each time you visit.<b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b>', 'Dubai', 'Breakfast', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251229_094919_c0a85bde_Day-6.webp', 4),
(163, 29, 29, 'Dubai Aquarium-Underwater Zoo-Burj Khalifa', 'Today morning after breakfast proceed for <b>Dubai mall </b>and be part of the mesmerizing <b>Dubai Aquarium & Underwater Zoo</b>, it offers fascinating insight into the worlds most mysterious marine life. Later in the evening proceed to visit the Burj Khalifa Described as both a \'Vertical City\' and \'A Living Wonder\', Burj Khalifa, developed by Dubai-based Emaar Properties PJSC, is the world\'s tallest building. Later enjoy the <b>musical fountain show</b>.<b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b>', 'Dubai', 'Breakfast', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251229_094919_ac66e1fa_Day-5.webp', 5),
(164, 29, 29, 'Dubai-Departure', 'After Breakfast at hotel Check out from hotel and get transferred to the airport to catch your flight back to your destination. <b>Tour End</b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b>', 'Tour Ends', 'Breakfast', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251229_094920_fea42b0e_Day-10.webp', 6),
(165, 30, 34, 'On arrival in Dubai Airport', 'On arrival in Dubai check-in to your hotel. Later Proceed to <b>Dubai Marina Cruise</b> it is a sight to behold and cruising through the canal beside it promises unparalleled views of the buildings that have become landmarks on the international map. Among the many sights you will pass by, some that you should not miss are the Burj Al Arab, Hotel Atlantis the Palm, Palm Jumeirah, Dubai Marina Yatch Club Promenade, and the Dubai Marina Mall. You will also get a chance to admire the unique architecture that surrounds the area in form of residential buildings, recreational spaces, and office buildings in evening or in night-time cruise you can see New Dubai glittering under the dark sky. Enjoy <b>Marina Dhow Cruise </b>with delicious dinner.<b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b>', 'Dubai', 'B+L+D', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251229_094918_f3684f57_Day-1.webp', 1),
(166, 30, 34, 'Half Day Dubai City Tour & Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner', 'Today after breakfast you will get an opportunity to get acquainted with Dubai city Tour Visit to Dubais famous landmarks such as the sail-shaped <b>Burj Al-Arab </b>hotel and beautiful Jumeirah Mosque, and learn interesting details about each attraction from a local guide. Take in views of the citys most picturesque palaces and residential areas, and venture into<b> Bastakiya</b>, Dubais inspiring old quarter. Cross Dubai Creek by abra (water taxi) and visit the Spice Soul. Vening<b> Enjoy Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner & Belly Dancing</b>.<b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b>', 'Dubai', 'B+L+D', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251229_094918_457607b9_Day-2.webp', 2),
(167, 30, 34, 'Snow Park', 'After breakfast, proceed for <b>Snow Park</b>.It is a part of the Mall of the Emirates, one of the largest shopping malls in the world, located in Dubai.<b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b>', 'Dubai', 'All Inclusive', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251229_094919_e8423c42_Day-7.webp', 3),
(168, 30, 34, 'Dubai Park Access', 'In the morning after breakfast get transferred to <b>dubai park </b>access. Lapita is the first park of its kind in the world. In five fascinating zones, you can experience (Any 2 Park Access) different environments inspired by the greatest Bollywood blockbusters.<b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b>', 'Dubai', 'All Inclusive', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251229_094919_11ac981a_Day-8.webp', 4),
(169, 30, 34, 'Dubai-Leisure', 'Today morning after breakfast spend the day as leisure to explore the city on your own and for shopping.', 'Dubai', 'B+L+D', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251229_094920_7d880c7f_Day-9.webp', 5),
(170, 30, 34, 'Dubai-Departure', 'After Breakfast at hotel Check out from hotel and get transferred to the airport to catch your flight back to your destination. <b>Tour End</b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b>', 'Tour Ends', 'Breakfast', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251229_094920_fea42b0e_Day-10.webp', 6),
