(241, 42, 29, 'Dubai-Departure', 'After Breakfast at hotel Check out from hotel and get transferred to the airport to catch your flight back to your destination. <b>Tour End</b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b>', 'Tour Ends', 'Breakfast', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251229_094920_fea42b0e_Day-10.webp', 6),
(242, 43, 29, 'Jaipur arrival', 'Arrive in Jaipur. Proceed to enjoy a half day sightseeing tour of Jaipur. Visit the City palace and local market etc', 'Jaipur', 'Breakfast', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251226_075831_e84ecae1_Day1.webp', 1),
(243, 43, 29, 'Mount Abu City Tour', 'After breakfast full day city tour includes Dilwara temple, The sun set point, Prajapita Bramhakumari Ashram and University-\'The impartation of Spiritual knowledge and meditation and picturesque Nakki Lake', 'Mount Abu', 'Breakfast', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251226_075831_cb8dde6d_Day3.webp', 2),
(244, 43, 29, 'Travel Jaisalmer to Jodhpur', 'After an early breakfast, proceed to Jodhpur. Upon arrival check in at the hotel. In the afternoon enjoy Jodhpur sightseeing. Visiting the best preserved fort of Rajasthan -the Mehrangarh fort. Later see the marble cenotaph at Jaswant Thada.', 'Jodhpur', 'Breakfast', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251226_075832_8b0983fb_Day12.webp', 3),
(245, 43, 29, 'Jodhpur Local sightseeing', 'After breakfast leave for Jodhpur local-Jodhpur-the stronghold of the fierce Rathore clan, was founded in 1459 by Prince Jodha. Visit the Mehrangarh Fort, situated on a low sandstone hill. Within the fort, visit Moti Mahal and Phool Mahal and Umaid Bhavan Palace.', 'Jodhpur', 'Breakfast', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251226_075832_da42321b_Day13.webp', 4),
(246, 43, 29, 'Day-14 Jodhpur Ajmer/Pushkar', 'After breakfast checkout from the hotel and visit Umaid Bhawan Palace and vintage car museum. Then proceed to Pushkar. Upon arrival check in at hotel. In the afternoon enjoy the sightseeing of Pushkar visiting Lord Bramha Temple, Holy Lake Pushkar and thr local colourful market.', 'Pushkar', 'Breakfast', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251226_075833_d4d8042a_Day14.webp', 5),
(247, 43, 29, 'Day-15 Pushkar Jodhpur Departure', 'After breakfast checkout from the hotel and visit the Ana sagar lake and Dargah. Later transfer to railway station / Airport at Jaipur for your onwards destination. Return home with eternal memories of you tour with Mango Holidays!', 'Tour End', 'Breakfast', 'https://itoursdemo.co.in/uploads/itinerary_images/20251226_075833_c942112c_Day15.webp', 6),
(248, 44, 24, 'Arrive Dubai Time at Leisure', 'On arrival at Dubai International Airport, you\'ll be transferred to your hotel. Upon arrival check in to the hotel and relax. ', 'Dubai', 'Breakfast', '', 1),
(249, 44, 24, 'Dubai: Morning at Leisure; Evening Dhow Cruise with Dinner', 'Enjoy breakfast at the hotel.\n\nIn the evening get ready to experience the Dhow Cruise. Cruising down Dubai creek is a novel experience, one which you cannot miss when in Dubai. Having fancy dinner on a Dhow Cruise with the fascinating lights of Dubai Creek and the soft music in the background, sip your favorite drink and enjoy a buffet dinner on board the cruise.', 'Dubai', 'Dinner', '', 2),
(250, 44, 24, 'Dubai Half Day City Tour  Followed By At the Top Burj Khalifa', 'After breakfast, proceed for a half day morning city tour, viewing some of the city most beautiful landmarks. The Magnificent Jumeriah Mosque built in 1979 is a fine example of modern Islamic architecture.\n\nYouï¿½ll be dropped back to Dubai Mall. You can use this time to have your lunch\n\nTake a closer look at the world below through avant-garde, high powered, telescopes. Step out onto the world\'s highest public outdoor observation terrace overlooking the ever growing skyline of Sheikh Zayed Road and surrounding panorama.\n\nReturn to hotel for a comfortable overnight stay.', 'Dubai', 'B+L+D', '', 3),
(251, 44, 24, 'Dubai-Abu Dhabi City Tour with a visit to Sheikh Zayed  Grand  Mosque', 'After breakfast, check out from your hotel in Dubai and proceed towards Abu Dhabi. \n\nAbu Dhabi, the capital of the UAE, is a gem to discover.\n\nProceed for an Abu Dhabi city tour, Abu Dhabi is the largest of the seven Emirates. Explore the majesty of the Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque.\nVisit Ferrari World or Yas Waterworld, Yas Waterworld, Warner Bros Park. After spending time at the park return to hotel for a comfortable overnight stay. ', 'Abu Dhabi', 'L+D', '', 4),
(252, 44, 24, 'Dubai Departure', 'Today enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Later check out and Transfer to Dubai airport for your departure flight. We hope you take back many happy memories of your holiday.', 'Tour End', 'Breakfast', '', 5),
(253, 45, 24, 'Arrive Dubai Time at Leisure', 'On arrival at Dubai International Airport, you\'ll be transferred to your hotel. Upon arrival check in to the hotel and relax. ', 'Dubai', 'Breakfast', '', 1),
